        {
          "text": " Akaulo kaŋun koduk arwatat nakokiŋa ore loka Daudi, ari nakoto naka Gikon, aditot, kiton neelomarere orute loka iboro lukocor; kirigaun Opel, kitonyou kooja noi; kibwaik ikapolok luetitiŋ oreria kere luebwaitai luka Yuda. ",
