        },
        {
          "text": "Aswamisio ace nuka Manase, ka akeilip mama ejai Edekeke, ka akiro nuka ikadwarak nualimonokinete ŋes kokiror loka EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael, koany, iwadikatai kaswamisio nuka ikabakan luka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
